I first bought a DM1701, &amp; installed the GD77 FW. Then a local programmed in his code plug. A week later I got a RT3S. Again I installed the GD77 FW, &amp; wrote the saved 1701 code plug into the RT3S. This way I don’t have to save different code plugs for the different radios. GARY<p>Statistics: Posted by <a href="http://localhost/opengd77/memberlist.php?mode=viewprofile&amp;u=8235">N4KVE</a> — Fri Jun 13, 2025 4:10 pm</p><hr />
